            "title": "Bio",
            "text": "<p>With 15 years as a professional rugby player, my foundation has always been strength conditioning. Hypertrophy was the base building the engine and armour first before progressing into maximal strength, power and plyometric work. In the gym it was about developing force. On the field it was about expressing it.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
