            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Rugby demands everything lift, sprint, jump, throw, pull, push and carry. You cannot excel in just one quality. You must be highly competent across them all. In many ways, rugby players were hybrid athletes long before the term became popular.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
