            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>After retiring, I threw myself into different training modalities CrossFit, HIIT, bodybuilding and Olympic lifting to expand my mindset and understanding. Each discipline taught me something different about structure, intensity and adaptation.<br/></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
